NOT COVERED

The scored rubric derives from Heinrich Kluver's taxonomy of hallucinatory
constants; the continuous axes in the Exp 03b pre-registration derive from
Suzuki, Schwartzman & Seth (2024). The wording here is licensed as above; the
underlying taxonomies belong to their authors and are cited in each
pre-registration.

Model weights (SDXL, SD 3.5, Qwen3-VL, Claude) carry their own licences and are
not distributed here.
